===Etymology===
{{PIE word|en|dwóh₁}}
From {{der|en|fr|diphtongue}}, from {{der|en|grc|δίφθογγος||two sounds}}, from {{m|grc|δίς||twice}} + {{m|grc|φθόγγος||sound}}.

