* {{IPA|en|/ˈdɪfˌθɔŋ/|a=US}}; {{a|en|proscribed}} {{IPAchar|/ˈdɪpˌθɔŋ/}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˈdɪfˌθɑŋ/|a=cot-caught|;|/ˈdɪpˌθɑŋ/<a:proscribed>}}
